# GitHub

- Remote: `https://github.com/mehrshad0289/mostafa_app.git`
- Default branch: `main`
- After a completed change: `git add`, `git commit`, `git push origin main`
- Do not force-push, amend published commits, or change git config
- Do not commit `.env*`, `.vercel`, `node_modules`, `.next`, tokens, or passwords
- Authenticate with existing git credentials or a local `GITHUB_TOKEN` env var
- Never write a GitHub PAT into the repo, docs, rules, or commit messages
